title: gentle_persist
---
Hazel: You don't have to be 'fine' here. That's the point of this place. What do you actually need?
-> What are you making?
    <<jump lantern_work>>
===
title: lantern_work
---
Hazel: Lantern cloth. It distributes warmth gently, slows things down a little. I have enough for a small weave — but I need silk-thread moss and cloud reed. Low-threat gathering. Nothing dangerous.
-> I'll gather them.
    <<fire_event hazel_q1_accepted>>
    <<jump grateful>>
-> Not right now.
    <<stop>>
===
title: grateful
---
Hazel: Thank you. You carry enough weight already — let me carry a little of yours for a change.
-> I'll be back soon.
    <<stop>>
